<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5540] Unexpected NPE when use hive in Flink Interpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5540</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When we use hive catalog in flink, the failed exception message is not expected.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In method `registerHiveCatalog`, when the env &apos;HIVE_CONF_DIR&apos; is not set, we expected the exception `InterpreterException(&quot;HIVE_CONF_DIR is not specified&quot;)`. But before this code scope, it will throw a NPE in line 492, because of `properties.getOrDefault(&quot;HIVE_CONF_DIR&quot;, System.getenv(&quot;HIVE_CONF_DIR&quot;))` is null.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The solution is&#160;straightforward: remove the `.toString`&lt;/p&gt;</description>
